# Pigeonhole has NO runtime secrets: the page is static and talks to the public Arc RPC anonymously.
# The variables below are only for the two scripts that spend real USDC on Arc mainnet.

# ── scripts/bench.sh (gas benchmark, ~$0.05 of USDC per N=25 run) ────────────
# Get from: `cast wallet new /path/to/dir` → a JSON keystore; fund the address with USDC on Arc (chain 5042)
#           via CCTP: https://docs.arc.io  (FAST transfer + forwarder ≈ minutes, ≈ 2 cents)
KS=/absolute/path/to/keystore.json
# Get from: the password you chose at `cast wallet new` — a plain text file, chmod 600, outside the repo
PW=/absolute/path/to/password.txt
# Optional: bench size — N balance-moving sweeps, R re-sweeps (defaults 25 / 8)
# N=25
# R=8

# ── contracts/script/Deploy.s.sol (forge script, one-time) ───────────────────
# Same keystore as above; `forge script --rpc-url arc --keystore $KS --password-file $PW`
# TREASURY=0xYourTreasuryAddress
